* LC1 (LoadCell, page 8): ADS1232 input filter R28/R29 100 ohm, C17 100 nF diff, C16/C18 10 nF to GND
* Two SOPLF-102 cells in parallel: 700 ohm output each -> 350 ohm source. C18 at -10 % to show CM->DM conversion.
Vdm dp dn AC 1                                 ; differential test signal (AC 1)
Rsp dp sp 175
Rsn dn sn 175
Vcm dn 0 AC 0
R28 sp ainp 100
R29 sn ainn 100
C17 ainp ainn 100n
C16 ainp 0 10n
C18 ainn 0 10n
* common-mode path: same network driven by a CM source, C18 low by 10 %
Vcm2 cm 0 AC 1
Rsp2 cm sp2 175
Rsn2 cm sn2 175
R28b sp2 ainp2 100
R29b sn2 ainn2 100
C17b ainp2 ainn2 100n
C16b ainp2 0 10n
C18b ainn2 0 9n
.ac dec 50 1 10Meg
.save V(ainp,ainn) V(ainp2,ainn2)
.meas ac DM_50Hz  FIND mag(V(ainp,ainn)) AT 50
.meas ac DM_f3dB  WHEN mag(V(ainp,ainn))=0.7071
.meas ac CMDM_1k  FIND mag(V(ainp2,ainn2)) AT 1k
.meas ac CMDM_1M  FIND mag(V(ainp2,ainn2)) AT 1Meg
.end
